=== GEN_RANDOM_UUID() returns a fresh UUID ===
# Each call returns a different value — we can't pin
# the exact value, so we just verify the result is a
# valid UUID by casting it through the type.
SELECT GEN_RANDOM_UUID() IS NOT NULL AS not_null;
